            "sectionHeading": "Fund recommendation"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The funds are part of our CIP (Centralised Investment Proposition). This is regularly reviewed by a quarterly investment committee. We also utilise a leading external research team to ensure regular monitoring and oversight of our recommended funds.",
